Subject: [PATCH] Wallet Edition back-office Wave A/C: wallet-admin console
 pages

Adds meridian-console pages (Next.js/React, typed-client pattern) for the new
wallet-edition modules, wired to the regenerated OpenAPI routes:
- Safeguarding reconciliation A-(B+C+D+E) dashboard (WE-RECON-1, G-10)
- Stock & float operations (WE-FLOAT-1, G-02)
- Order & Pay / ETM monitor (WE-ETM-1, G-08)
- Wallet disputes + transaction corrections (WE-OPS-1, G-09)
- Vouchers (WE-TXN-1, G-03), Cash-out authorisations (WE-TXN-2, G-07)
- Commission earnings (WE-PRICE-1, G-05), Transfer control profiles (WE-LIMIT-1, G-04)
Plus nav entries (new Reconciliation group). Follows the existing usePaged/Table pattern.

